- **Unmerged Graham figures:** `<email redacted>` has 403 lines (34.0%), `<email redacted>` has 377 (31.8%), and `<email redacted>` has 2.
- **Bus factor:** it is 1 for the whole of `src/Parser`, because Graham alone holds 65.9% of the lines. Reaching 80% takes 2 authors. Bus factor here means the fewest authors whose surviving lines reach 50% of the lines counted.
- **Left out:** `src/Parser/Unicode/CharTable.php` (431 lines) is generated, so it is excluded from every number. No reformat commit was found.
- **Mechanical rewrites:** I checked 48 commits and set aside none.
- **Copy detection:** `-w -M -C` moved 80 lines in 3 files to another author. Graham's share is 65.9% with it and 66.7% without. Vance Lucas's 10 lines appear only with copy detection.
- **Moved lines:** 365 of the 1,187 lines (30.7%) were written elsewhere (`src/Parser.php`, `src/Value.php`, `src/Lines.php`) and moved or copied in. Credit goes to whoever wrote them, not to whoever moved them.
- **Unusual identities:** `root` and `Your Name` hold 117 and 69 lines. They look like unconfigured git identities, so they will need mapping to real people, but I can't tell who from the history.

**`Lexer.php`**

This file has 58 lines. Counting Graham Campbell's addresses as one person, he holds 58 lines (100%). Unmerged:
